      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To stream microphone audio and yield interim transcripts, I need to use a concrete external provider. I will use the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API for this task. This API is identifiable by the import of the `google.cloud.speech` module and the use of the `SpeechClient` class. </thinking>\n",
